<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Holy Touch</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Paladin (guild level 100)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast holy touch &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast holy touch</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The paladin speaks the liturgy of the gods and touches the target, which 
wounds those who lean to evil. Any target whose alignment is below 0 can be struck, even a neutral who 
leans to evil, and the truly evil are hurt more; on anyone of alignment 0 
or above, nothing happens. The better your divine power and your skill in 
the spell, the more it hurts. It hurts most through clothes and least through plate, which 
takes about a third less, and being a touch, a shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while 
fighting. It is also found on scrolls. 
Stronger prayers follow: holy grasp and holy shout.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
